# Gitignored files copied into every worktree Claude Code creates (`claude --worktree`,
# `isolation: worktree` subagents, desktop parallel sessions). Without these the gates run
# without their API keys and fail in a way that looks like a code objection rather than a
# missing secret. Uses .gitignore syntax; only files that are BOTH matched here and gitignored
# are copied, so tracked files are never duplicated.
#
# Our scheduled routines do NOT go through this file — they call
# `scripts/routine_worktree.ts create`, which SYMLINKS these instead of copying, so a rotated
# key takes effect everywhere at once and cleanup never leaves a stale secret on disk.
# See docs/routine_worktrees.md.
.env
services/api/.env
